*q*t+(1)*p*t*hh10+(-2)*p*t^2*hh5+(-2)*q*t^2*hh4+(4)*t^3*hh5,(1/8)*p^2*eta+(-1)*p*t*eta+(2)*t^2*eta,(1/4)*p*q*eta+(-1)*q*t*eta,(-1/8)*t*eta+(1/8)*q^2*eta,(-3/8)*p^3+(7/2)*p^2*t+(-12)*p*t^2+(16)*t^3,(-3/4)*p^2*q+(23/4)*p*q*t+(-17/2)*q*t^2+(1)*p^2*t*hh10+(-2)*p*t^2*hh10+(4)*t^3*hh10,(3/8)*p*t+(-3/2)*t^2+(-3/8)*p*q^2+(9/4)*q^2*t+(1)*p*q*t*hh10+(-1)*p*t^2*hh4+(-2)*p*t^2*hh11+(-2)*q*t^2*hh10+(4)*t^3*hh11};
